<title>PORTUGAL: Banco Mello returns to profit in 1996.</title>
<headline>Banco Mello returns to profit in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending Dec 31</p>
<p>(In billions of escudos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		    0.5   vs     1.8 loss</p>
<p>    Operating profit	    2.3   vs     1.3 loss</p>
<p>    Cashflow		     13.4   vs     8.9</p>
<p>    Financial margin	   28.2   vs    22.7</p>
<p>    Liquid assets	   1,141.2   vs   831.6</p>
<p>    Deposits		    681.6   vs   595.0</p>
<p>    Client loans		504.7   vs   377.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Banco Mello Comercial is full company name.</p>
